# Orastery Woes (windurst 86): Kuroido-Moido in Port Windurst (+7: the first entity of the name is cutscene-only), the
# qm1 and Eldhrimnir in Ro'Maeve (the shape of Blood and Glory's flows). A level-75 WAR (can equip the Club of Trials:
# level 71, WAR among its jobs), with the club already held at 300 weapon skill points (item wsp=300). Making Amends
# completed by GM and Windurst fame below level 4: Kuroido-Moido's script then starts nothing (Making Amens' offer needs
# level 4), and he has no default, so a nil turn plays nothing. The offer's skill edge (Club 2299, under 230 a level:
# not offered; 2300: 578), the trade while the check holds (the club: no trade handler in section 1, nothing), 578's
# finish with the club held (no second club: the Weapon Training Guide alone, begun), 579 with the club held (param 2;
# option 0: nothing; option 1, held: nothing), the trades while accepted (a chip; the club and a chip: nil; the club at
# 300 points: 581, its finish takes the club and gives the Map to the Annals of Truth), 582, the qm1 (the map, no
# annals: Eldhrimnir pops, claimed, SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE; the NM up: popFromQM false, nil), the kill (the map held:
# killed_wsnm 1), the qm1's Annals of Truth (killed_wsnm reset), the qm1 with both key items (nil; again once its body is
# gone: nil, no pop), 583 (completed: fame +20; the map, the annals and the guide taken; Black Halo learned,
# BLACK_HALO_LEARNED), then completed: nothing and a trade (nothing). #offer (no club held; level 71), #offer_guide,
# #offer_job and #offer_level take the offer's other arms, #abandon 579's other options without the club, #wsp299 the
# trade's edge, #gm_nomap the qm1 and the NM without the map or without the quest.
# Defaults: Kuroido-Moido none; the qm1 NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY (no script; Ro'Maeve's DefaultActions). Also named:
# Kuroido-Moido by Making Amends (completed, its mustZone clear: nil) and missions (ASA 3, Windurst 1-1, 6-1: not
# current); the Ro'Maeve qm1 by no other quest of a char like this one.
lists PortWindurst/Kuroido-Moido/onTrigger PortWindurst/Kuroido-Moido/onTrade PortWindurst/onEventFinish/578 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/579 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/581 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/583 Romaeve/qm1/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-110.7,-4.25,102.06 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.MakingAmends completed
skill Club 2299
item BoneChip
item ClubOfTrials wsp=300
login
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # Club 2299 (getCharSkillLevel / 10 is below 230): not offered; nothing (his script: Making Amends completed, fame below level 4: nothing; no default)
skill Club 2300
walk -110.7,-4.25,102.06
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 ClubOfTrials x1                     # the check holds: no trade handler in section 1, nothing; the club kept
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # can equip, Club 2300, no guide: event 578 (oncePerZone)
finish                                              # the club held: no second club; the Weapon Training Guide; begun
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # accepted, no key items, the club held: event 579 (0, Club of Trials, 0, 0, 2)
finish option=0                                     # nothing
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 579 again
finish option=1                                     # the club held: nothing
walk -110.7,-4.25,102.06
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 BoneChip x1                         # not the club: nil
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 ClubOfTrials x1 BoneChip x1         # the club and a chip: not exact, nil
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 ClubOfTrials x1                     # 300 weapon skill points: progressEvent 581 (0, 0, Annals of Truth)
finish                                              # the club taken; the Map to the Annals of Truth
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # the map: event 582
finish
warp 199.3,-8.1,-27.5 Romaeve
trigger qm1                                         # the map, no annals: Eldhrimnir pops (claimed); SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE
trigger qm1                                         # the NM spawned: popFromQM false, nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
kill ELDHRIMNIR                                # the map held: local killed_wsnm 1
trigger qm1                                         # killed_wsnm 1: reset; the Annals of Truth
trigger qm1                                         # both key items, killed_wsnm 0: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
tick 15000                                          # its body despawns (one zone tick per tick statement, as #gm_nomap)
tick 15000
tick 15000
trigger qm1                                         # both key items, it is gone: the annals held, so no pop; nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp -110.7,-4.25,102.06 PortWindurst
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # the annals (and the map): progressEvent 583
finish                                              # completed; the key items taken; Black Halo; BLACK_HALO_LEARNED
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # completed: no section; nothing (his script: Making Amends completed, fame below level 4: nothing; no default)
walk -110.7,-4.25,102.06
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 BoneChip x1                         # completed: no trade handler, nothing
